  "summary": "<p><strong>Injunctive Authority Clarification Act of 2025&nbsp;</strong></p><p>This bill prohibits federal courts from issuing injunctive orders that bar enforcement of a federal law or policy against a nonparty, unless the nonparty is represented by a party in a class action lawsuit.</p>",
